        <summary>Creates event data with the specified initialization status.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>The constructor stores the supplied value without validation. The Android initialization callback supplies <see cref="F:Android.Speech.Tts.OperationResult.Success" /> or <see cref="F:Android.Speech.Tts.OperationResult.Error" />, but this constructor does not restrict the value to those two results.</para>
